    "name": "QLoRA",
    "title": {
      "zh": "量化与低秩微调",
      "en": "Quantized low-rank tuning"
    },
    "description": {
      "zh": "将冻结的预训练模型量化为 4 bit，并训练 LoRA 适配器，降低微调显存需求。学习重点是量化精度、低秩适配与显存开销之间的关系。",
      "en": "A frozen 4-bit base model is adapted with trainable LoRA adapters to reduce fine-tuning memory requirements."
    },
